<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-MEN'S CZECH INDOOR OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEN'S CZECH INDOOR OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>OSTRAVA, Czech Republic 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$475,000 men's Czech Open indoor tennis tournament on Wednesday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>Martin Damm (Czech Republic) beat Dennis Van Scheppingen</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat George Bastl (Switzerland) 6-4 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5)</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) beat 8-Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>3-Boris Becker (Germany) beat Frederik Fetterlein (Denmark) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Nicolas Lapentti (Ecuador) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Todd Martin (U.S.) beat Cristiano Caratti (Italy) 6-4 6-1</p>
</text>
